flowchart TD
  D["Documents"] --> V["Build the vocabulary"]
  V --> B["Bag of words<br/>count each word, order dropped"]
  B --> TF["TF: how often in this document"]
  B --> IDF["IDF: log(N / documents containing it)<br/>rare words weigh more"]
  TF --> W["TF × IDF"]
  IDF --> W
  W --> X["Sparse document vectors<br/>→ cosine search, classifiers"]
